## Interface: 120005, 50503, 20505, 11508, 120007
## Title: Diesal Continued
## Notes: Continuation of Diesal's BSD 3-clause widget kit (DiesalGUI / DiesalTools / DiesalStyle / DiesalMenu, c. 2014). Provides the same LibStub MAJORs as the 2014 originals so any addon that depends on them keeps working.
## Author: ChronicTinkerer (original libraries by Diesal/diesal2010)
## Version: 2
## X-Category: Library
## X-License: BSD 3-clause
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1536687
## X-WoWI-ID: 27138
## DefaultState: enabled
## LoadOnDemand: 0

# LibStub: every addon library system needs it. Vendored copy.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua

# LibSharedMedia-3.0: cross-addon font/texture/sound registry. DiesalStyle
# registers its bundled fonts with LSM for cross-addon discoverability.
# The lookup inside DiesalStyle is soft (silent if LSM isn't present),
# but vendoring LSM here keeps Diesal Continued self-contained.
Libs\LibSharedMedia-3.0\LibSharedMedia-3.0.lua

# CallbackHandler-1.0: required by DiesalGUI for its widget event
# dispatch. This is the upstream WoWAce / ElvUI library; we ship a copy
# so the addon doesn't depend on something else having loaded it.
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua

# DiesalTools: small shared utility module the rest of the family uses.
DiesalTools-1.0\DiesalTools-1.0.lua

# DiesalStyle: textures, outlines, fonts, media registration. Required
# by DiesalGUI's widget rendering.
DiesalStyle-1.0\DiesalStyle-1.0.lua

# DiesalGUI: the 12-widget framework (Window, Button, CheckBox, Input,
# ScrollFrame, Spinner, DropDown, ComboBox, etc). The .xml loads the
# DiesalGUI-1.0.lua entry point and every Objects/*.lua file.
DiesalGUI-1.0\DiesalGUI-1.0.xml

# DiesalMenu: context-menu widgets layered on top of DiesalGUI.
DiesalMenu-1.0\DiesalMenu-1.0.xml
